{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-94-1","title":"Psalms 94:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet, calling for justice, complains of tyranny and impiety. 8 He teaches God's providence. 12 He shews the blessedness of affliction. 16 God is the defender of the afflicted.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3416. B.C. 588. (Title.)Dr. Delaney supposes that this Psalm was written by David on occasion of his war with the Ammonites, in consequence of the indignities shewn to his messengers; but it is more probable that it was written to bewail the destruction of Jerusalem and the temple.</p>\n<p>God, to whom vengeance belongeth. Heb. God of revenges.O God. De 32:35,41,42; Isa 35:4; 59:17; Jer 50:28; Na 1:2; Ro 12:19 2Th 1:8; Heb 10:30 shew thyself. Heb. shine forth. 80:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-2","title":"Psalms 94:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Lift. 7:6; 68:1; 74:22; Mic 5:9 thou. 50:6; Ge 18:25; Joh 5:22,23; 2Co 5:10 render. 31:23; Job 40:11,12; Isa 2:11,12,17; 10:12; 37:23,29,36-38 Jer 50:31,32; Da 4:37; 5:22-24; 1Pe 5:5; Re 18:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-3","title":"Psalms 94:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Lord. 43:2; 73:8; 74:9,10; 79:5; 80:4; 89:46; Jer 12:1,2; 47:6; Re 6:10 the wicked. Es 5:11,12; 6:6-10; 7:6,10; Job 20:5; Ac 12:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-4","title":"Psalms 94:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>shall. 31:18; 59:7,12; 64:3,4; 73:8,9; 140:3; Pr 30:14; Jer 18:18 Mt 12:24,34; Jude 1:14,15 boast. 10:2-7; 52:1; Ex 15:9,10; Job 21:14,15; Isa 10:13-15; 37:24,25 Da 7:8,11,25; 8:11; 11:36,37; Re 13:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-5","title":"Psalms 94:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>break. 7:2; 14:4; 44:22; 74:8,19,20; 79:2,3,7; 129:2,3; Isa 3:15; 52:5 Jer 22:17; 51:20-23,34; Mic 3:2,3; Re 17:6 afflict. Ex 2:23,24; Jer 50:11; Re 11:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-6","title":"Psalms 94:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Isa 10:2; 13:15-18; Jer 7:6; 22:3; Eze 22:7; Mal 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-7","title":"Psalms 94:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>they say. 10:11-13; 59:7; Job 22:12,13; Isa 29:15; Eze 8:12; 9:9; Zep 1:12 Lu 18:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-8","title":"Psalms 94:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>brutish. 49:10; 73:22; 92:6; Pr 12:1; Isa 27:11; Jer 8:6-8; 10:8; Ro 3:11 fools. De 32:29; Pr 1:22; 8:5; Tit 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-9","title":"Psalms 94:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>He that planted. Ex 4:11; Pr 20:1,12 hear. 11:4; 17:3; 44:21; 139:1-12; Jer 23:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-10","title":"Psalms 94:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>chastiseth. 9:5; 10:16; 44:2; 135:8-12; 149:7; Isa 10:12; 37:36; Jer 10:25 Eze 39:21 he correct. Isa 10:5,6; Am 3:2; Hab 1:12; 3:12 teacheth man. 25:8,9; 119:66; Job 35:11; Pr 2:6; Isa 2:3; 28:26; 54:13; Joh 6:45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-11","title":"Psalms 94:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>49:10-13; Job 11:11,12; Ro 1:21,22; 1Co 1:19,21,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-12","title":"Psalms 94:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Blessed. 119:67,71; Job 5:17; Pr 3:11; 1Co 11:32; Heb 12:5-11 teachest. Job 33:16-25; Mic 6:9; Re 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-13","title":"Psalms 94:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>mayest. Isa 26:20,21; Hab 3:16; 2Co 4:17,18; 2Th 1:7,8; Heb 4:9; Re 14:13 until the pit. 9:15; 55:23; Jer 18:20,22; 2Pe 2:9; 3:3-7; Re 6:10,11; 11:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-14","title":"Psalms 94:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>For. 37:28; 1Sa 12:22; Isa 49:14,15; Jer 32:39,40; Joh 10:27-31 Ro 8:30,38,39; 11:1,2; Heb 13:5 forsake. 5; 34:12; De 32:9; Jer 10:16; Eph 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-15","title":"Psalms 94:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>But. 2,3; 7:8,9; 9:16; 58:11; 125:3; De 32:35,36; Job 35:14; Mic 7:9 Mal 3:18; 2Pe 3:8-10; Re 15:3,4 and all. 37:5-7,34; 125:4,5; Job 17:9; 23:11,12; Jas 5:7-11; 1Jo 2:19 shall follow it. Heb. shall be after it.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-16","title":"Psalms 94:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>rise up. Ex 32:26-29; Nu 25:6-13; Jud 5:23; 1Ki 18:39,40; 2Ki 9:32; 10:15 Isa 59:16; 63:5; Jer 5:1; Eze 22:30; Mt 12:30; 3Jo 1:8 stand up. Ne 5:7; Jer 26:16-19; Joh 7:50,51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-17","title":"Psalms 94:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Unless. 118:13; 124:1,2; 125:1; 142:4,5; Joh 16:32; 2Co 1:8-10; 2Ti 4:16,17 almost. or, quickly. dwelt. 13:3; 31:17; 115:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-18","title":"Psalms 94:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>My foot. 17:5; 37:23,24; 38:16; 119:116,117; 121:3; 1Sa 2:9; Joh 12:5 Isa 41:10; Lu 22:32; 1Pe 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-19","title":"Psalms 94:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>43:2-5; 61:2; 63:5,6; 73:12-16; 77:2-10; Jer 20:7-11; Hab 3:16-18 Ro 5:2-5; 2Co 1:4,5; 1Pe 1:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-20","title":"Psalms 94:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>throne. 52:1; 82:1; 1Sa 22:12; Ec 3:16; 5:8; Am 6:3 fellowship. 2Ch 6:14-16; Isa 1:11-20; Jer 7:4-11; Joh 18:28; 1Jo 1:5,6 frameth. 58:2; 1Ki 12:32; Es 3:6-12; Isa 10:1; Da 3:4-7; 6:7-9; Mic 6:16 Joh 9:22; 11:57; Re 13:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-21","title":"Psalms 94:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>gather. 2:1-3; 22:16; 59:3; Pr 1:11,16; Mt 27:1; Ac 4:5-7,27,28 condemn. Ex 23:7; 1Ki 21:19; Pr 17:15; Jer 26:15; Eze 22:6,12,27 Mt 23:32-36; Ac 7:52,58-60; Jas 5:6; Re 17:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-22","title":"Psalms 94:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>But. 10; 27:1-3; 59:9,16,17; 62:2,6 the rock. 18:2; Isa 33:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-94-23","title":"Psalms 94:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":94,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":94,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>And he. 7:16; 9:16,17; 55:23; 64:8; Es 7:10; Pr 1:31; 2:22; 5:22; Da 7:24 cut them. 12:3; 1Sa 26:10,11; Pr 14:32; Eze 18:24; Da 9:26</p>"}]}